## [bug|blocked] Memory Leak in WebSocket Handler
WebSocket connections not properly cleaned up after disconnect.
→ requires: verify.emd
Reproduction: Open 100 concurrent connections, disconnect 50, memory grows unbounded.

### [subtask|in-progress] Add Connection Tracking
Added connection ID tracking in handler.

