## [detail|done] Query Optimization Details
The slow query in UserController.list() was caused by an N+1 issue in the ORM.
Join fetch was not configured for the roles association.
FIX: Added `@JoinFetch` annotation to the `roles` field on the User entity.
Query time went from 2.3s to 45ms.

```sql
SELECT u.*, r.* FROM users u
LEFT JOIN user_roles ur ON u.id = ur.user_id
LEFT JOIN roles r ON ur.role_id = r.id;
```

## [memory|archived] Initial Architecture Decisions
When we started this project in January, we chose:
- Monorepo structure (Nx)
- PostgreSQL for primary data
- Redis for caching and sessions
- AWS ECS for deployment
- GitHub Actions for CI/CD
→ precedes: spec.emd
→ references: decisions.emd

